					],
					"text": "The format example `provider/model (effort)` becomes `провайдер/модель (усилия)`. The exact English sidecar explicitly requires keeping both `provider/model` and `(effort)` as written because they show the line format the user must type. This violates the protected input-syntax contract, not merely terminology preference.",
